      profileImageUrl: undefined,
      text: `It seems Moses was reminding God about what they are there for (as if God needs the reminder). The important part of this chapter, I believe, is found right here in this prayer. The people may not have known that Moses prayed this, but now they do, and now it seems that everything they had gone through, and everything they did, built up to this moment.`,
