      verse: 5,
      author: 'Tried By Fire',
      authorHandle: '@TriedByFire',
      profileImageUrl: undefined,
      text: `This is where the many religions differ today. They think “Well, we have the Lord because of our righteousness before Him, so He will deliver us through our burdens.” Incorrect. Not to be Calvinistic here, but the Lord delivers whom He pleases, not based off of your righteousness, but based off of His sovereignty. This is a touchy subject, to be sure, but it is one that needs to be understood by the believers.`,
