      verse: 5,
      author: 'Tried By Fire',
      authorHandle: '@TriedByFire',
      profileImageUrl: undefined,
      text: `It’s okay that God has a Will, and does what He knows will be the best fit for everyone involved. To us, it seems that God loves us because we are so good, but in all reality there is no good thing in us... "For I know that in me (that is, in my flesh,) dwelleth no good thing: for to will is present with me; but how to perform that which is good I find not." Romans 7:18`,
